{
  "_comment": [
    "INERT BY DESIGN. Rename this file to .classroom50/tests.json to activate it.",
    "",
    "This is a PORTABLE grading spec: it lets the tests that score this",
    "assignment live in the student repo instead of only in the teacher's",
    "classroom50 config repo. It does nothing until (a) you rename it and",
    "(b) the classroom installs the portable autograder for this assignment.",
    "",
    "SECURITY: anyone who can push to this repo can edit this file, including",
    "the student being graded. Results graded from here are stamped",
    "tests_source=student-repo and trusted=false in the gradebook. Read",
    "docs/writing-tests.md, section 'Portable specs', before enabling it on",
    "anything that counts toward a grade.",
    "",
    "The keys below mirror the classroom `tests` block exactly, so a spec can",
    "move in either direction without translation."
  ],

  "schema": "classroom50/tests/v1",

  "tests": [
    {
      "name": "module imports",
      "type": "run",
      "run": "python3 -c \"import src.stats\"",
      "points": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "pytest suite",
      "type": "python",
      "setup": "python3 -m pip install --quiet -r requirements.txt",
      "run": "python3 -m pytest -q tests/test_stats.py",
      "timeout": 120,
      "points": 12
    }
  ]
}
